WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.136
Required from optional.

00:00:02.136 --> 00:00:04.087
Passing from failing.

00:00:04.087 --> 00:00:06.223
Signal from decoration.

00:00:06.223 --> 00:00:12.910
You spent this room telling things apart, and never once by color alone.

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:18.112
Name the skill, one word, and the chamber is mine again.
